001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"Your flag is dealt with, but you quickly notice that something's wrong. Your crew aren't waiting for you on deck. The Sea Cat isn’t even tied to the dock now that you look closely.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":9.504,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":34},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":9.504,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":34},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Then Captain Neckbeard looks out over the railing of your ship, squinting at you.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":9.92,"end":13.568,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":14},"large":{"start":9.92,"end":13.568,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\"Ahoy there! Got tired of racing you around town trying to beat you to the best crew, so I thought I'd do the smart thing and take them after you rounded them up for me! They were loyal to you, but I'm sure a week in the brig will change their minds.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":14.656,"end":31.968,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":52},"large":{"start":14.656,"end":31.9,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":52},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Then he laughs and turns his back as The Sea Cat pulls away with the wind. He's stolen your ship and your crew, and now he's off to steal your treasure.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":32.288,"end":40.288,"frac":0.903,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":31},"large":{"start":32.288,"end":40.288,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"But then your phone buzzes. It's a text from your first mate saying, \"THE ROPE\".","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":40.832,"end":45.024,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":15},"large":{"start":40.832,"end":45.024,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Dangling over the side of the ship, you see the strong surveyor's rope you bought. One end is tied to The Sea Cat's far railing, and the rest of it is untied and floating in the water below your feet.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":45.632,"end":55.712,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"large":{"start":45.632,"end":55.712,"frac":0.975,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":40},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92e6531131_PC%20JM13.png"}